      "content": "The draft is pretty blunt about it. It's proposing a move away from complex neural architecture toward a rules-based algorithmic system to ensure the board can see exactly why every decision is being made. Essentially, they're looking to phase out the current autonomous forecasting models by Q3 next year to improve oversight. Give me your honest take—how would a transition like that actually play out in a real market scenario?",
